# V4 Scalper
### New York Range Breakout · Re-Entry Confirmation · Structured Risk Management

**A rule-based scalping system built around the New York midnight range, five-minute candle confirmation, and predefined risk-to-reward levels.**

V4 Scalper identifies price breakouts beyond a defined New York trading range and waits for price to close back inside that range before determining a trade direction.

Rather than treating every breakout as a trade, the strategy uses a breakout-and-re-entry sequence to identify potential failed breakouts and reversals.

The application runs from the V4 project environment and maintains persistent trade state using SQLite.

---

## Strategy Overview

The strategy uses the first four hours of the New York day to establish a reference range.

After the range is established, the system monitors closed five-minute candles for a breakout followed by a confirmed close back inside the range.

