## Risk and Reward Framework

V4 defines trade management using an R-multiple framework, where **1R represents the initial distance between the entry price and the stop-loss price**.

| Milestone | Default target |
|---|---:|
| TP1 | 1R |
| TP2 | 1.5R |
| TP3 | 2R |

TP3 is the default final target at 2R. TP1 and TP2 are intermediate milestones.

The actual outcome depends on entry execution, stop placement, market conditions, and the system's implemented trade-management rules. Target levels alone do not guarantee profitability.

